{{> header text='Hello!' }}
<p>
   You have been invited to join the organization "{{ organization_name }}" on {{platform_name}} by {{ inviter_last_name }} {{ inviter_first_name }}. To join the organization, and create an account, click the link below.
</p>

<p>
    {{> button button_url=organization_invite_url button_text='Join organization' }}
</p>

<p>This invitation is valid for {{ invitation_lifetime }}.</p>
<p style="margin-top:15px;">If you do not wish to use the {{platform_name}} platform and join this organization, then this email can safely be ignored.</p>
{{> footer }}
